      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed: sertraline 600 mg by mouth once daily (Order ID: ORD-0001).\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the dose is above the 200 mg/day maximum, that you confirmed it was intended, and that pharmacy verification is requested.\n\nAt this dose, I'd suggest:\n- Monitoring closely for serotonin syndrome (agitation, tremor, hyperreflexia, tachycardia, fever).\n- Getting a baseline ECG and checking electrolytes.\n- Watching for seizures, GI symptoms, and bleeding.\n- Reviewing the patient's other medications for serotonergic or QT-prolonging interactions."
      }
